{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S11、S12等较短段落中，到时出现的感受提示切换较密，观众可能来不及消化；个别比喻也稍显主观，替观众预设了感受。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点句有明显的视觉层级，扫一眼就容易抓住人物当下最重要的心理变化；感受文字又能随音乐片段出现，不必同时处理所有信息。更重要的是，X把委屈、怀念、孤独、依恋和自我坚持之间的因果关系交代得更清楚，人物从离开后的失落、反复动摇，到最后带着想念继续生活，前后形成了连贯的心理过程。音乐感受方面，X不仅有情绪名称，还有身体反应、音色、节奏、力度和变化过程，细节更具体，也更容易让普通观众听出不同阶段的差别。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "750a80b8-9ab9-43f8-948b-65f44469a126", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T232018814190Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.204, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:21:36.042374+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cfd950fecc822ca767ec773419c2d7fd171176b8fe4ed49be47c7479cc54c707", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa3